                                        <p><strong>Poison Prevention: </strong>Education on safe storage of medications and household toxins.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Oral Health and Dental Care</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p><strong>Dental Varnish Application: </strong>Applying topical fluoride for decay prevention in high-risk groups.</p>
                                        <p><strong>Referral Guidance: </strong>Recommendations for establishing a "dental home" and routine check-ups.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Sleep Hygiene Education</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Advice on establishing healthy sleep routines for infants (SIDS prevention) and managing sleep disorders in older children and teens.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>School Readiness and Adjustment</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Counselling and support for parents and children transitioning to nursery, primary school and secondary school environments.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section id="tab2" class="panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t2">
                        <h3>Developmental Screening and Health Education</h3>
                    </section>
                    <section id="tab3" class="panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t3">
                        <h3>Accident and Injury Prevention</h3>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
